 " [:a {:href "/athletes/12609"} "Piet Raymakers"] ". However, on his second ride, Raymakers was 0.66 seconds over the time limit, giving him 0.25 faults and dropping him to the silver medal, as Beerbaum won gold. American " [:a {:href "/athletes/11870"} "Norman Dello Joio"] ", the 1983 World Cup champion who was competing in his first Olympics, took the bronze aboard " [:a {:href "/horses/"} "Irish"] ", recording 4.75 faults in the second round after a clean ride in round one. He was the son of well-known composer and namesake, Norman Dello Joio. Britain’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/12996"} "John Whitaker"] " also went clear in round one, but his 19.25 faults in the second round dropped him to 14th place overall."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "654"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11606"} "Ludger Beerbaum"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/490"} "Classic Touch"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "165.50 (23)"] [:td {} "0.00 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "698"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12609"} "Piet Raijmakers"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/2047"} "Ratina Z"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {} "155.00 (=27)"] [:td {} "0.25 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "729"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11870"} "Norman Dell